    {
      "principle": "A wife is entitled to be maintained by her husband and has a right to reside in the matrimonial home.",
      "held": "A Hindu wife is entitled to be maintained by her husband. She is entitled to remain under his roof and protection. She is also entitled to separate residence if by reason of the husband's conduct or by his refusal to maintain her in his own place of residence or for other just cause she is compelled to live apart from him.",
